    "slug": "brittle-nails-reasons-and-treatment",
    "excerpt": "Just the way your skin can tell a lot about your internal health, in the same way, your nails too are a window into the status of your wellbeing. They are also ...",
    "category": "Clinical Dermatology",
    "readTime": "5 min read",
    "author": "Dr. Divya Sharma, MBBS (Gold Medalist), MD",
    "date": "Jul 01, 2018",
    "imageMode": "single",
    "singleImage": "https://www.drdivyasharma.com/assets/blog_inner/b71811920d4490f1ee6ee52bd7b4bd4d.jpg",
