    "excerpt": "Common Skin Irritants Skin acts as the primary medium of defense against foreign bodies. Every day the skin is exposed to various types of irritants which may c...",
    "category": "Clinical Dermatology",
    "readTime": "5 min read",
    "author": "Dr. Divya Sharma, MBBS (Gold Medalist), MD",
    "date": "Jan 15, 2018",
    "imageMode": "single",
