    "excerpt": "Clear all the skin imperfections quickly with an effective and trendy Red Carpet Peel or Hollywood Laser Peel treatment. This treatment brings a dramatic differ...",
    "category": "Laser & Aesthetics",
    "readTime": "7 min read",
