    "title": "Period Skincare: How your menstrual cycle can change your skincare routine",
    "slug": "period-skincare",
    "excerpt": "Women know the drill, periods spring up on us every month, followed by cravings, cramps, mood swings and much more. Every month women undergo a number of change...",
    "category": "Clinical Dermatology",
    "readTime": "11 min read",
    "author": "Dr. Divya Sharma, MBBS (Gold Medalist), MD",
