    "excerpt": "What are the 7 commonly asked questions about open pores on the face? A large number of people complain about open pores and with so many products and informati...",
    "category": "Clinical Dermatology",
    "readTime": "10 min read",
    "author": "Dr. Divya Sharma, MBBS (Gold Medalist), MD",
    "date": "Nov 03, 2020",
    "imageMode": "single",
    "singleImage": "https://www.drdivyasharma.com/assets/blog_inner/20951c4625f6e2467dbbab3fcacabfcf.jpg",
