    "slug": "07-best-treatments-that-you-can-go-for-to-close-open-pores-on-face",
    "excerpt": "As a Dermatologist in Bangalore , I come across several commonly asked questions about treatment of open pores on the face. There is very less information avail...",
    "category": "Clinical Dermatology",
    "readTime": "9 min read",
    "author": "Dr. Divya Sharma, MBBS (Gold Medalist), MD",
    "date": "Dec 18, 2020",
    "imageMode": "single",
    "singleImage": "https://www.drdivyasharma.com/assets/blog_inner/981071703981c565358f1e58e70dc95d.jpg",
