    "excerpt": "5 Monsoon Skin care Tips for Healthy Skin Monsoon might be a great respite from the hot summer, but the unpredictable weather brings its own share of skincare i...",
    "category": "Clinical Dermatology",
    "readTime": "6 min read",
    "author": "Dr. Divya Sharma, MBBS (Gold Medalist), MD",
    "date": "Jul 22, 2022",
    "imageMode": "single",
    "singleImage": "https://www.drdivyasharma.com/assets/blog_inner/3ea851bc0a840e3014a84c6c66ffac80.png",
