    "excerpt": "Are you tired of dull skin, pigmentation, acne scars, or signs of ageing? If your skincare routine isn't delivering results, you might want to consider a treatm...",
    "category": "Laser & Aesthetics",
    "readTime": "10 min read",
    "author": "Dr. Divya Sharma, MBBS (Gold Medalist), MD",
