    "excerpt": "If you have continuous itchy, red, or flaky skin areas, you may be dealing with more than just dry skin. Psoriasis, an everyday but sometimes misdiagnosed skin ...",
    "category": "Clinical Dermatology",
    "readTime": "10 min read",
    "author": "Dr. Divya Sharma, MBBS (Gold Medalist), MD",
