    "slug": "Types-of-Dermal-Fillers",
    "excerpt": "Aging is natural—but who says you can’t age beautifully? As the years go by, your skin starts to lose volume, firmness, and that youthful glow. That’s where der...",
    "category": "Clinical Dermatology",
    "readTime": "8 min read",
    "author": "Dr. Divya Sharma, MBBS (Gold Medalist), MD",
    "date": "Jul 07, 2025",
    "imageMode": "single",
    "singleImage": "https://www.drdivyasharma.com/assets/blog_inner/2620429241a145ffc585b0f5575f7869.png",
