    "excerpt": "You may have heard the saying, “You are what you eat”-but when it comes to skin, it's absolutely true. Having spent a decade exploring the relationship between ...",
    "category": "Pigmentation & Glow",
    "readTime": "9 min read",
    "author": "Dr. Divya Sharma, MBBS (Gold Medalist), MD",
    "date": "Jul 07, 2025",
    "imageMode": "single",
    "singleImage": "https://www.drdivyasharma.com/assets/blog_inner/7301f6b237dc9e5a74d3a5d7f1de5d1b.png",
