    "excerpt": "Hair loss is more than just a cosmetic concern-for many, it impacts self-confidence and emotional well-being. I've seen countless treatments rise and fall in po...",
    "category": "Hair & Scalp",
    "readTime": "9 min read",
    "author": "Dr. Divya Sharma, MBBS (Gold Medalist), MD",
    "date": "Jul 07, 2025",
