    "title": "How Many Microneedling Sessions Do You Really Need for Glowing Skin?",
    "slug": "Microneedling-Sessions-for-glowing-skin",
    "excerpt": "If you've been scrolling through skincare reels or reading beauty blogs, chances are you’ve come across microneedling—a treatment that’s winning hearts for its ...",
    "category": "Pigmentation & Glow",
    "readTime": "7 min read",
    "author": "Dr. Divya Sharma, MBBS (Gold Medalist), MD",
    "date": "Aug 06, 2025",
    "imageMode": "single",
    "singleImage": "https://www.drdivyasharma.com/assets/blog_inner/76b9ad8837658c1150ce230dd6a14925.png",
