    "excerpt": "Ever wondered why your skin looks dull even when you're using great skincare? Or why does your hair feels weak despite trying every hair serum out there? The an...",
    "category": "Hair & Scalp",
    "readTime": "9 min read",
    "author": "Dr. Divya Sharma, MBBS (Gold Medalist), MD",
