    "excerpt": "Dealing with large cystic pimples can be frustrating and painful. Unlike regular pimples, cystic acne forms deep under the skin, often causing redness, swelling...",
    "category": "Acne & Scars",
    "readTime": "6 min read",
    "author": "Dr. Divya Sharma, MBBS (Gold Medalist), MD",
    "date": "Aug 21, 2025",
    "imageMode": "single",
    "singleImage": "https://www.drdivyasharma.com/assets/blog_inner/866ba1fbaf37244841f6f3403c0d1a5d.png",
