    "excerpt": "Psoriasis is more than just a skin condition—it can affect confidence, comfort, and daily life. The itchy, red patches and scaling can be both physically painfu...",
    "category": "Clinical Dermatology",
    "readTime": "5 min read",
    "author": "Dr. Divya Sharma, MBBS (Gold Medalist), MD",
    "date": "Oct 01, 2025",
    "imageMode": "single",
